policy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ia7DkpnicEhhdpd6HloxtelXBykicgZG6Pzt3FB71dHUGmeJAno3DbYgciaoS1VuPicSHdrGUuFvVnomWKpm8vozQ3w/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NUFu8zwW8icIkQaqxLLpLcUxzNwNCRdffdnPyialCHj0H5xuqibv7icTzXl2UtMpAibjQ94JBmfOPYyF8Yxicuzicalhg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>活动简介</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>南方科技大学力学与航空航天工程系（简称“力航系”）计划于2025年6月中下旬举办全国优秀大学生夏令营活动。夏令营旨在增进国内高校优秀本科生对力学和航空航天学科的了解、感受力航系的特色的教学科研氛围、提前选拔2026年推免硕士研究生和直博研究生。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>南科大将为录取的优秀学子提供丰厚的奖助学金和一流的科研条件，欢迎全国的优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名对象</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NUFu8zwW8icIkQaqxLLpLcUxzNwNCRdffdnPyialCHj0H5xuqibv7icTzXl2UtMpAibjQ94JBmfOPYyF8Yxicuzicalhg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1、全国高校本科三年级在校生（2026届本科毕业生）</span></span></p><p><span>2、成果突出的优秀往届本科生和应往届硕士生</span></p><p><span>3、成绩优秀，英语水平良好</span></p><p><span>4、科研兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力</span></p><p><span>5、身心健康、诚实守信、学风端正</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NUFu8zwW8icIkQaqxLLpLcUxzNwNCRdffdnPyialCHj0H5xuqibv7icTzXl2UtMpAibjQ94JBmfOPYyF8Yxicuzicalhg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gWHiblvjGeWt3ibib6rapzR5RkQpBGOgFiasL1sCdttMGtIuwibxD1LUCKB2NfGzoF857QgtJflXm5wcnKLKCtC4MRw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NUFu8zwW8icIkQaqxLLpLcUxzNwNCRdffdnPyialCHj0H5xuqibv7icTzXl2UtMpAibjQ94JBmfOPYyF8Yxicuzicalhg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NUFu8zwW8icIkQaqxLLpLcUxzNwNCRdffdnPyialCHj0H5xuqibv7icTzXl2UtMpAibjQ94JBmfOPYyF8Yxicuzicalhg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>日程安排</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WKcu9lDsnTSMhApKzjCZOv0NibpRzCAP2fXAEE58NJB8KHTj8dhRqyBKUy7eHh0JBxxLyn0s15JqjLWCibTJmQ0g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1、活动时间：预计2025年6月中下旬。</span></p><p><span>2、活动安排：开营仪式、师生互动、实验室及校园参观、推免生面试、科普大咖前沿讲座、闭营仪式等。</span></p><p><span>3、活动费用：夏令营暂定以线下方式举行，南科大力航系将为异地学校营员提供夏令营期间在深圳的免费食宿，并给予部分路费补贴。深圳地区高校学生原则上不提供住宿和路费补贴，仅提供免费用餐。</span></p><p><span>*活动安排以最终公布为准，请大家持续关注；</span></p><p><span>*营员须按要求全程准时参加活动。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/ahYgKq35SuNaus1wuQZsiaWoC6vXKM7wx1ibsyD8ziajOwZ5PFG9Kgic5LPcrAf6MFnScUjkeW7unMlnvp2Cj1tC9Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NUFu8zwW8icIkQaqxLLpLcUxzNwNCRdffdnPyialCHj0H5xuqibv7icTzXl2UtMpAibjQ94JBmfOPYyF8Yxicuzicalhg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>活动咨询</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WKcu9lDsnTSMhApKzjCZOv0NibpRzCAP2fXAEE58NJB8KHTj8dhRqyBKUy7eHh0JBxxLyn0s15JqjLWCibTJmQ0g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>有关夏令营的活动咨询，请优先以“2025夏令营咨询”为邮件主题发送给maeyzb@sustech.edu.cn。</span></span></p><p><span>或致电：0755-88018154 张老师</span></p><p><span>或加入南科大力航系夏令营官方QQ群：768740429（备注姓名-学校-专业）</span></p><p><span>招生主页：https://mae.sustech.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/80yjXeVt6PwKn3iaWFPPV7fwLicSicq9EnqoIa6PwYJzAfddXtnfsR2JjqxyMD4q6MfamYdjDy8w4AUS6wjALbBiaw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/vibrtmTRJnnvxdA4Q3G36HzfmZ3UuhOl0Y0vRJ1NS3wxD7A0Sx2W5Holb8hOo3aEX2unc2Kl9Gmjx6vaZu9ptjA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gWHiblvjGeWt3ibib6rapzR5RkQpBGOgFiasL1sCdttMGtIuwibxD1LUCKB2NfGzoF857QgtJflXm5wcnKLKCtC4MRw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NUFu8zwW8icIkQaqxLLpLcUxzNwNCRdffdnPyialCHj0H5xuqibv7icTzXl2UtMpAibjQ94JBmfOPYyF8Yxicuzicalhg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/R4ribGaaTk6eCqLFpmicQBib82BZ0WZ71yqKsqlI8IhkfSZfdW21nxuzF3T67DSWSCj2icacOxryNouTQmnibKQsRicw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>网上申报</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>网址：南方科技大学研究生招生服务系统https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/ （建议使用Chrome或360极速浏览器）点击“全国优秀大学生夏令营”进行在线报名，需填报不超过3位意向导师，按要求提供本人各项真实信息，并上传相关材料：</span></span></p><p><span>（1）身份证正反面复印件</span></p><p><span>（2）学生证复印件（在校生提供）或毕业证书与学位证书复印件（往届生提供）</span></p><p><span>（3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务加盖公章，硕士生需同时提交本科成绩单），成绩单上注明所在专业的成绩排名</span></p><p><span>（4）个人陈述PDF,介绍学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作、以及将来攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、研究生毕业后的就业目标等，1000字以内。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（5）其他体现个人学术水平、综合能力的证明材料（包括但不限于英语水平证书、论文首页及奖状证书等，扫描为一个PDF后上传系统）</span></p><p><span>（6）夏令营报名申请表（签字版），请先在系统完成报名申请，提交后下载打印夏令营报名申请表，按要求签字后提交至系统。</span></p><p><span>（7）副教授以上专家书面推荐信2封。申请推免直博研究生的同学，必须提交专家推荐信2封，申请推免硕士研究生同学可自愿提交。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/R4ribGaaTk6eCqLFpmicQBib82BZ0WZ71yqKsqlI8IhkfSZfdW21nxuzF3T67DSWSCj2icacOxryNouTQmnibKQsRicw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>申请截止时间</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2025年6月16日09：00</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/R4ribGaaTk6eCqLFpmicQBib82BZ0WZ71yqKsqlI8IhkfSZfdW21nxuzF3T67DSWSCj2icacOxryNouTQmnibKQsRicw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>审核选拔</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请截止后，夏令营评审工作小组将对学生的申请材料进行审核，通过资格审核者将通过报名系统以及电子邮件形式通知，未通过者不作另外通知。</span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/ahYgKq35SuNaus1wuQZsiaWoC6vXKM7wxH1DoYA9rZ0U22V1WicNotIEma609wJjRjzib72wPeJiaW736CmNibNOrHA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NUFu8zwW8icIkQaqxLLpLcUxzNwNCRdffdnPyialCHj0H5xuqibv7icTzXl2UtMpAibjQ94JBmfOPYyF8Yxicuzicalhg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>文字 | 张雪茹</span></p><p><span>编辑 </span><span>| 张雪茹